ur", "label_ar": "متعلق بحال من الأحزاب (الجدول نصا)، متعلقان بمحذوف حال (الميسر ودعاس نصا). وفيه إشارة إلى أن قوم نوح كانوا حزبا أيضا (ابن عاشور نصا)", "note_md": null, "word_occurrence_id": null, "is_virtual": 0, "tafsir_note_md": null, "tafsir_refs": null, "balagha_note_md": null, "balagha_refs": null, "gloss_json": null, "sarf_note_md": null, "sarf_refs": null, "sarf_term_ref": null, "gram_term_ref": "GT:irab_role:jarr_majrur"}, {"id": "QR:SSN:40:5:s1:$.tree.children[3].children[0].children[0]", "tree_id": "QR:TR:40:5:s1", "parent_node_id": "QR:SSN:40:5:s1:$.tree.children[3].children[0]", "node_label": "بَعْدِهِمْ", "scope_type": null, "scope_id": null, "depth": 3, "node_order": 8, "created_at": "2026-08-28 18:22:08", "term_key": "majrur", "label_ar": "مجرور بمن وهو مضاف والهاء مضاف إليه", "note_md": null, "word_occurrence_id": "cc3faa8ffa8f8940799a126f58", "is_virtual": 0, "tafsir_note_md": null, "tafsir_refs": null, "balagha_note_md": null, "balagha_refs": null, "gloss_json": null, "sarf_note_md": null, "sarf_refs": null, "sarf_term_ref": null, "gram_term_ref": "GT:irab_role:jarr_majrur"}, {"id": "QR:SSN:40:5:s1:$.tree.children[2].mudaf", "tree_id": "QR:TR:40:5:s1", "parent_node_id": "QR:SSN:40:5:s1:$.tree.children[2]", "node_label": "قَوْمُ", "scope_type": null, "scope_id": null, "depth": 2, "node_order": 4, "created_at": "2026-10-08 11:50:30", "term_key": "mudaf", "label_ar": null, "note_md": null, "word_occurrence_id": "8ea95872a1a00704a5fe4151ba", "is_virtual": 0, "tafsir_note_md": null, "tafsir_refs": null, "balagha_note_md": null, "balagha_refs": null, "gloss_json": null, "sarf_note_md": null, "sarf_refs": null, "sarf_term_ref": null, "gram_term_ref": "GT:irab_role:mudaf"}, {"id": "QR:SSN:40:5:s2:$.tree", "tree_id": "QR:TR:40:5:s2", "parent_node_id": null, "node_label": "وَهَمَّتْ كُلُّ أُمَّةٍ بِرَسُولِهِمْ لِيَأْخُذُوهُ", "scope_type": null, "scope_id": null, "depth": 0, "node_order": 1, "created_at": "2026-08-28 18:22:35", "term_key": "jumlah_filiyyah", "label_ar": "لا محل لها معطوفة على جملة كذبت — اتفاق رباعي", "note_md": null, "word_occurrence_id": null, "is_virtual": 0, "tafsir_note_md": null, "tafsir_refs": null, "balagha_note_md": null, "balagha_refs": null, "gloss_json": null, "sarf_note_md": null, "sarf_refs": null, "sarf_term_ref": null, "gram_term_ref": "GT:sentence_class:filiyya"}, {"id": "QR:SSN:40:5:s2:$.tree.children[0]", "tree_id": "QR:TR:40:5:s2", "parent_node_id": "QR:SSN:40:5:s2:$.tree", "node_label": "وَ", "scope_type": null, "scope_id": null, "depth": 1, "node_order": 2, "created_at": "2026-08-28 18:22:35", "term_key": "harf_atf", "label_ar": "حرف عطف (دعاس والجدول والميسر نصا)", "note_md": null, "word_occurrence_id": "67269ef956b7692b5e5c6ca0fe", "is_virtual": 0, "tafsir_note_md": null, "tafsir_refs": null, "balagha_note_md": null, "balagha_refs": null, "gloss_json": null, "sarf_note_md": null, "sarf_refs": null, "sarf_term_ref": null, "gram_term_ref": "GT:pos:harf_atf"}, {"id": "QR:SSN:40:5:s2:$.tree.children[1]", "tree_id": "QR:TR:40:5:s2", "parent_node_id": "QR:SSN:40:5:s2:$.tree", "node_label": "هَمَّتْ", "scope_type": null, "scope_id": null, "depth": 1, "node_order": 3, "created_at": "2026-08-28 18:22:35", "term_key": "fiil_madi", "label_ar": "ماض معطوف على كذبت (دعاس نصا). والهم العزم، وحقه أن يعدى بالباء إلى المعاني لأن العزم فعل نفساني لا يتعلق إلا بالمعاني، فإذا عدي إلى اسم ذات تعين تقدير معنى يدل عليه المقام (ابن عاشور نصا)", "note_md": null, "word_occurrence_id": "67269ef956b7692b5e5c6ca0fe", "is_virtual": 0, "tafsir_note_md": null, "tafsir_refs": null, "balagha_note_md": null, "balagha_refs": null, "gloss_json": null, "sarf_note_md": null, "sarf_refs": null, "sarf_term_ref": null, "gram_term_ref": "GT:pos:fil"}, {"id": "QR:SSN:40:5:s2:$.tree.children[2]", "tree_id": "QR:TR:40:5:s2", "parent_node_id": "QR:SSN:40:5:s2:$.tree", "node_label": "كُلُّ أُمَّةٍ", "scope_type": null, "scope_id": null, "depth": 1, "node_order": 4, "created_at": "2026-08-28 18:22:35", "term_key": "fail", "l